    turnFlow: 'Build down by rank on the tableau (any suit); in-suit sequences may be moved together. A complete run of 13 cards in one suit (King down to Ace) is removed from the tableau. When no column is empty, deal 10 cards from the stock (one per column). Continue until all eight sequences are removed (win) or no legal move and no deal remains (loss).',
